    # "Over the next month or so, we fell into quite an enjoyable pattern."
    "Alrededor del mes siguiente, empezamos a seguir un patrón bastante agradable."

# game/script.rpy:1174
translate es ch3_4fb4a5d6:

    # "Pastille would show up at my doorstep maybe once or twice a week..."
    "Pastille se aparecía en mi puerta puede que una o dos veces por semana..."

# game/script.rpy:1175
translate es ch3_89332bf5:

    # "Sometimes we'd go out to dinner, but mostly he'd just spend the night 💙"
    "A veces salíamos a cenar, pero casi siempre se quedaba a pasar la noche 💙"

# game/script.rpy:1176
translate es ch3_ea2c2997:

    # nvl clear
    # "It was starting to become almost routine--though each visit was somehow just as exciting as the last~"
    nvl clear
    "Empezaba a ser casi una rutina--aunque, de alguna manera, cada visita era tan emocionante como la anterior~"

# game/script.rpy:1178
translate es ch3_e1acc37c:

    # "The details of which... I'll choose to keep private, for Pastille's sake. That boy is insatiable, I WILL say that! 💙"
    "Los detalles de los cuales... preferiré mantener en privado, por el bien de Pastille. ¡Aunque DIRÉ que ese chico es insaciable! 💙"

# game/script.rpy:1179
translate es ch3_2ae57261:

    # nvl clear
    # "Inevitably, after seeing someone for long enough, one begins to pick up on their habits..."
    nvl clear
    "Inevitablemente, después de ver a alguien por bastante tiempo, uno empieza a aprenderse sus hábitos..."

# game/script.rpy:1181
translate es ch3_308c6522:

    # "Cute habits. Like the way he kisses me on the cheek before rushing off to work in the early morning."
    "Lindos hábitos. Como la forma en que me besa en la mejilla antes de correr al trabajo temprano en la mañana."

# game/script.rpy:1182
translate es ch3_f8c37e9b:

    # "The way he runs his hand through his hair when he's thinking really hard about something."
    "La forma en la que se pasa la mano por el cabello cuando está pensando demasiado sobre algo."

# game/script.rpy:1183
translate es ch3_7f9de784:

    # nvl clear
    # "Even his knock is specific--once, lightly, to test the waters. A pause, as he gathers his courage. Then three, firm and evenly-spaced."
    nvl clear
    "Hasta su forma de llamar a la puerta es específica--Un golpe, leve, para probar. Una pausa, mientras reune el valor. Luego tres, firmes y parejos."

# game/script.rpy:1185
translate es ch3_13949e8f:

    # "I'm not sure which of these habits he's conscious of, but there's one I've decided he MUST be acting knowingly..."
    "No estoy seguro de cuál de estos hábitos es consciente, pero hay uno que he deducido que DEBE estar haciendo a propósito..."

# game/script.rpy:1186
translate es ch3_05e82852:

    # "Which is, his habit of leaving one of his personal effects behind with each visit."
    "O sea, su hábito de dejar uno de sus objetos personales tras cada visita."

# game/script.rpy:1187
translate es ch3_a1186f11:

    # nvl clear
    # "First, a barrette. Then an earring. His choker, a bracelet..."
    nvl clear
    "Primero, un pasador. Luego un pendiente. Su collar, un bracalete..."

# game/script.rpy:1189
translate es ch3_72eea756:

    # "And then he returns after a few days with an apology, explaining he had just come to pick up whatever he'd left behind."
    "Y luego vuelve después de unos días con una disculpa, explicando que solo viene a buscar algo que se le olvidó."

# game/script.rpy:1190
translate es ch3_13faa860:

    # nvl clear
    # w pj calm "Sure, Pastille. Keep creating your little excuses to come back here... I'll happily go along with them."
    nvl clear
    w pj calm "Claro, Pastille. Sigue creando tus pequeñas excusas para volver aquí... con gusto te seguiré la corriente."

# game/script.rpy:1193
translate es ch3_80258f58:

    # w happy "Hmhm, what fun! I wonder what he'll come looking for THIS time~?"
    w happy "Hmhm, ¡qué divertido! Me pregunto qué vendrá a buscar ESTA vez~"

# game/script.rpy:1195
translate es ch3_5245ed5c:

    # n "Periwinkle gathers up the discarded garments that had been left strewn across his bedroom, tossing them into a pile to be dealt with later."
    n "{size=-4}Periwinkle recoge las prendas tiradas que quedaron esparcidas por la habitación, acumulándolas en una pila para ocuparse de ello más tarde.{/size}"

# game/script.rpy:1197
translate es ch3_57dc11fb:

    # w oh "He couldn't possibly leave his underwear behind, could he...?"
    w oh "No pudo haber dejado su ropa interior, ¿o sí...?"

# game/script.rpy:1198
translate es ch3_2577a914:

    # w calm "No, that would be impossible to explain. An earring, sure, but there's no way he'd walk out of here like THAT..."
    w calm "No, eso sería imposible de explicar. Un pendiente, seguro, pero es imposible que saliera de aquí ASÍ..."

# game/script.rpy:1200
translate es ch3_b4f5ffdc:

    # n "Periwinkle hums to himself as he makes the bed, double-checking between the sheets while he's at it..."
    n "Periwinkle tararea para sí mismo mientras hace la cama, revisando nuevamente entre las sábanas mientras lo hace..."

